---
---

<section id="why-us" class="py-24 relative overflow-hidden bg-[#0A0A0A] border-t border-white/10">
  <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-8">
    
    <div class="text-center max-w-3xl mx-auto mb-16">
      <div class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 px-3.5 py-1 rounded-full bg-[#FF6B00]/10 border border-[#FF6B00]/30 text-[#FF6B00] text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-widest mb-3">
        <span>O Nosso Padrão</span>
      </div>
      <h2 class="font-royal text-3xl sm:text-4xl lg:text-5xl font-bold text-white mb-4">
        Porquê Escolher o <span class="text-orange-gradient">Royal Hair Salon</span>?
      </h2>
      <p class="text-neutral-400 text-sm sm:text-base">
        Elevamos o corte masculino a um patamar de precisão artística e conforto absoluto em Odivelas.
      </p>
    </div>

    <!-- 4 Pillars Grid -->
    <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-4 gap-6">
      
      <!-- Pillar 1 -->
      <div class="glass-panel p-7 rounded-2xl relative group hover:border-[#FF6B00]/60 transition-all">
        <div class="w-14 h-14 rounded-2xl bg-[#FF6B00]/15 border border-[#FF6B00]/30 text-[#FF6B00] flex items-center justify-center text-2xl mb-6 group-hover:scale-110 transition-transform shadow-[0_0_20px_rgba(255,107,0,0.25)]">
          ✂️
        </div>
        <h3 class="font-royal font-bold text-white text-lg mb-2">Fade Milimétrico</h3>
        <p class="text-xs text-neutral-400 leading-relaxed">
          Degradê perfeito sem marcações visíveis. Dominamos Skin Fade, Taper Fade, Low Fade e Mid Fade com geometria adaptada ao seu crânio.
        </p>
      </div>

      <!-- Pillar 2 -->
      <div class="glass-panel p-7 rounded-2xl relative group hover:border-[#FF6B00]/60 transition-all">
        <div class="w-14 h-14 rounded-2xl bg-[#FF6B00]/15 border border-[#FF6B00]/30 text-[#FF6B00] flex items-center justify-center text-2xl mb-6 group-hover:scale-110 transition-transform shadow-[0_0_20px_rgba(255,107,0,0.25)]">
          ♨️
        </div>
        <h3 class="font-royal font-bold text-white text-lg mb-2">Toalha Quente & Spa</h3>
        <p class="text-xs text-neutral-400 leading-relaxed">
          O ritual tradicional com toalha aquecida e infusão de óleos aromáticos que abrem os poros, amaciam a barba e eliminam a irritação.
        </p>
      </div>

      <!-- Pillar 3 -->
      <div class="glass-panel p-7 rounded-2xl relative group hover:border-[#FF6B00]/60 transition-all">
        <div class="w-14 h-14 rounded-2xl bg-[#FF6B00]/15 border border-[#FF6B00]/30 text-[#FF6B00] flex items-center justify-center text-2xl mb-6 group-hover:scale-110 transition-transform shadow-[0_0_20px_rgba(255,107,0,0.25)]">
          🛡️
        </div>
        <h3 class="font-royal font-bold text-white text-lg mb-2">Esterilização UV & Descartável</h3>
        <p class="text-xs text-neutral-400 leading-relaxed">
          Lâminas 100% descartáveis e ferramentas esterilizadas com radiação ultravioleta e desinfetantes de nível cirúrgico. Segurança em 1º lugar.
        </p>
      </div>

      <!-- Pillar 4 -->
      <div class="glass-panel p-7 rounded-2xl relative group hover:border-[#FF6B00]/60 transition-all">
        <div class="w-14 h-14 rounded-2xl bg-[#FF6B00]/15 border border-[#FF6B00]/30 text-[#FF6B00] flex items-center justify-center text-2xl mb-6 group-hover:scale-110 transition-transform shadow-[0_0_20px_rgba(255,107,0,0.25)]">
          ☕
        </div>
        <h3 class="font-royal font-bold text-white text-lg mb-2">Hospitalidade VIP</h3>
        <p class="text-xs text-neutral-400 leading-relaxed">
          Café expresso de cortesia, Wi-Fi ultra-rápido, cadeiras reclináveis ergonómicas e uma atmosfera onde se sente verdadeiramente em casa.
        </p>
      </div>

    </div>

    <!-- Stats Bar -->
    <div class="mt-16 grid grid-cols-2 md:grid-cols-4 gap-6 p-8 rounded-2xl glass-panel border border-white/10 text-center">
      <div>
        <div class="font-royal text-3xl sm:text-4xl font-extrabold text-[#FF6B00]">12k+</div>
        <div class="text-xs text-neutral-400 uppercase tracking-wider mt-1">Cortes Realizados</div>
      </div>
      <div>
        <div class="font-royal text-3xl sm:text-4xl font-extrabold text-white">4.9★</div>
        <div class="text-xs text-neutral-400 uppercase tracking-wider mt-1">Classificação Google</div>
      </div>
      <div>
        <div class="font-royal text-3xl sm:text-4xl font-extrabold text-[#FF6B00]">99.4%</div>
        <div class="text-xs text-neutral-400 uppercase tracking-wider mt-1">Clientes Satisfeitos</div>
      </div>
      <div>
        <div class="font-royal text-3xl sm:text-4xl font-extrabold text-white">0 min</div>
        <div class="text-xs text-neutral-400 uppercase tracking-wider mt-1">Espera com Marcação</div>
      </div>
    </div>

  </div>
</section>
